mentum on cost reduction in 2020 and reaching our EUR19.5 billion target for adjusted costs excluding transformation charges and the costs associated with the Prime Finance platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/deutsche-bank-ag-db-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"DB 2019 Q4","e":"db","d":"2020-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James von Moltke","x":"Noninterest expenses of EUR6.4 billion included approximately EUR1.3 billion of restructuring and severance, litigation and transformation charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/deutsche-bank-ag-db-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"DB 2020 Q1","e":"db","d":"2020-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christian Sewing","x":"The team continue to actively reprice deposits in the first quarter and this puts us on a good track to pass-through negative interest rates to EUR25 billion of deposits in 2020 as part of our 2022 targets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/deutsche-bank-ag-db-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"DB 2020 Q1","e":"db","d":"2020-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Christoph Blieffert","x":"And here, in particular, whether, there's a fee from KfW for banks passing through the loan to the client?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/deutsche-bank-ag-db-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"DB 2020 Q1","e":"db","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christian Sewing","x":"Core Bank pre-tax profit grew by 32% year-on-year to EUR1.1 billion, excluding specific revenue items, restructuring and severance and transformation charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/deutsche-bank-ag-db-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"DB 2020 Q1","e":"db","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christian Sewing","x":"The management team and I are determined to not let the current environment disrupt the execution of our cost reduction plans.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/deutsche-bank-ag-db-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"DB 2020 Q2","e":"db","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christian Sewing","x":"In other words, we have achieved 50% of our cost-reduction plans just 18 months into our 4-year program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/deutsche-bank-ag-db-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"DB 2020 Q2","e":"db","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christian Sewing","x":"In the first half of the year, we have achieved all cost savings as planned.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/deutsche-bank-ag-db-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"DB 2020 Q2","e":"db","d":"2020-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christian Sewing","x":"Against this background, we confirm our guidance for full year provision for credit losses of 35 to 45 basis points of loans.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/deutsche-bank-ag-db-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"DB 2020 Q2","e":"db","d":"2020-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James von Moltke","x":"We're three months later than where we were in April, and we are reaffirming the guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/deutsche-bank-ag-db-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"DB 2020 Q3","e":"db","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James von Moltke","x":"Excluding specific revenue items, restructuring and severance and transformation charges, the Core Bank generated a post-tax return on tangible equity of 6.8% in the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/deutsche-bank-ag-db-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DB 2020 Q3","e":"db","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James von Moltke","x":"Pretax profit in the Corporate Bank was EUR189 million in the quarter, or EUR243 million excluding transformation charges and restructuring and severance, which we detail in the appendix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/deutsche-bank-ag-db-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DB 2020 Q4","e":"db","d":"2021-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christian Sewing","x":"This was in part driven by headcount reductions, with our workforce down by 8% over this period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/deutsche-bank-ag-db-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DB 2020 Q4","e":"db","d":"2021-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christian Sewing","x":"Overall, we have achieved more than 300 key milestones and over 100% of the cost savings anticipated from our core transformation initiatives in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/deutsche-bank-ag-db-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DB 2021 Q1","e":"db","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"James von Moltke","x":"The increase in costs was driven by higher variable compensation resulting from DWS' share price increase and platform investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/deutsche-bank-ag-db-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DB 2021 Q1","e":"db","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christian Sewing","x":"As it relates to costs within our control, we remain committed to our EUR16.7 billion target for 2022, and we are working toward it every day, executing on cost-saving measures as we planned.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/deutsche-bank-ag-db-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DB 2021 Q1","e":"db","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christian Sewing","x":"We remain committed to minimizing the P&L impact of derisking efforts by the un